OL,3,GNEWSAStreet renamed after Sir Ken Dodd
OL,4,
OL,5,FA street in Blackpool has been renamed
OL,6,Fin honour of comedian Sir Ken Dodd.
OL,8,FAdelaide Street West on the resort's
OL,9,FGolden Mile has become Sir Ken Dodd
OL,10,FAvenue in tribute to the Liverpool
OL,11,Fentertainer, who died in 2018 aged 90.
OL,13,FThe new name was unveiled by the star's
OL,14,Fwidow Lady Anne Dodd, who said she was
OL,15,F"thrilled" because of her husband's
OL,16,Flong association with the town.
OL,18,FIt coincides with a Ken Dodd exhibition
OL,19,Fat Blackpool's Showtown museum.
